      "content": "It sounds like you're seeing the whole, bleak picture, and it's exhausting to feel like the only logical conclusion is to opt out. If the game itself is rigged, then the most rational move is to stop participating in the rigged system. You don't have to keep spinning the wheel for anyone else's sake; your own peace is worth more than proving a point to a broken cycle.",
